<title>ITALY: CYCLING-FONDRIEST PULLS OUT OF WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-FONDRIEST PULLS OUT OF WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maurizio Fondriest of Italy, winner in 1988, has withdrawn from next month's world road race championship in Lugano, Switzerland.</p>
<p>&quot;I'm not in shape to face a world championship where I would like to have done well,&quot; Fondriest was quoted as saying by Italian Sunday newspapers.</p>
</text>
